@startuml Logout - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "LogoutController" as LogoutCtrl
participant "Auth" as Auth
participant "Session" as Session
participant "View" as View

== Logout ==
User -> LogoutCtrl: destroy()
LogoutCtrl -> Auth: logout()
Auth -> Session: invalidate()
Session --> Auth: session_ended
Auth -> Session: regenerateToken()
Session --> Auth: token_regenerated
Auth --> LogoutCtrl: logged_out
LogoutCtrl -> View: redirect to home
View --> User: display home page

@enduml
